{"parentUuid":"2734b791-a2bf-4f07-a3d8-872820871dd8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"**یافته بحرانی ششم — آمار سرتیتر Proposal اشتباه است:** Liemberger & Wyatt (که **در همین Corpus هست**) می‌گوید NRW جهانی **۱۲۶ میلیارد مترمکعب در سال** (۳۴۶ میلیون m³/روز، ۳۰٪ حجم ورودی، ۳۹ میلیارد دلار) و صریحاً برآورد ۲۰۰۶ بانک جهانی را «**extremely conservative**» می‌نامد. Proposal عدد منسوخ **۳۲ میلیارد** را آورده و آن را به **Guo et al. 2013** (مقاله‌ای درباره فیزیک نشت از ترک دوبعدی) نسبت داده.\n\nادامه استخراج شواهد روش‌شناختی:","type":"text"}],"id":"0f5e3ee0afa8fa3f889438d745d8ca0f","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1243,"cache_read_input_tokens":282806,"output_tokens":2030,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1243},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"20260825062810378390644g7cmjVD4hskq5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c2d4979c-7c74-48ed-8687-16443f9bf84e","timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:28:38.552Z","effort":"max","session_id":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\Thesis","sessionId":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","version":"2.1.240","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"c2d4979c-7c74-48ed-8687-16443f9bf84e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01YVj3y4hB3HMNpaWjZn6sWN","input":{"command":"F=\"/d/Thesis/papers/Multi-agent reinforcement learning framework for real-time scheduling of pump and valve in water distribution networks.pdf\"; echo \"=== counts ===\"; for t in PRV \"pressure reducing\" throttle TCV emitter Anytown Net3 \"c-town\" uncertainty robust generaliz continuous discrete PDA DDA; do printf \"%-18s \" \"$t\"; pdftotext -enc UTF-8 \"$F\" - 2>/dev/null | grep -aoi -- \"$t\" | wc -l; done; echo \"=== valve/network context ===\"; pdftotext -enc UTF-8 \"$F\" - 2>/dev/null | grep -aoiE \".{100}(valve setting|the valve|case study network|test network|demand uncertainty).{120}\" | head -5","description":"Extract Hu MARL valve type and network"},"name":"Bash","type":"tool_use"}],"id":"0f5e3ee0afa8fa3f889438d745d8ca0f","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1243,"cache_read_input_tokens":282806,"output_tokens":2030,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1243},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"20260825062810378390644g7cmjVD4hskq5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e5924b93-1e64-450b-926f-c38c0b0c65c5","timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:28:42.287Z","effort":"max","session_id":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\Thesis","sessionId":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","version":"2.1.240","gitBranch":"main"}
