{"parentUuid":"3e25ca66-7dc0-4b49-99cb-66f2a3ac0fbb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"**شواهد کلیدی روش‌شناختی:** Kåge et al. 2025 صریحاً می‌گوید «**only a few studies have benchmarked policy-based against value-based RL algorithms... future research should encourage the implementation of both**» و «automating reward function design» را شکاف می‌داند (یعنی وزن‌دهی دستی، رویه رایج است نه نوآوری).\n\nآخرین گام: دو مقاله ۲۰۲۶ که در Corpus شما نیستند:","type":"text"}],"id":"426bfa6851edca27fcb03fa6ea15e7c0","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5961,"cache_read_input_tokens":284049,"output_tokens":1522,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5961},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"2026082506292885970661725tlbQD2AP7g8","type":"assistant","uuid":"3bc5e7ea-6d2d-474c-bc37-56952143b4f1","timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:29:52.730Z","effort":"max","session_id":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\Thesis","sessionId":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","version":"2.1.240","gitBranch":"main"}
