{"parentUuid":"fa19cb1c-8cb0-465d-b490-407de3a816ca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"**این مهم‌ترین یافته کل این Phase است.** بخش «کارهای آینده» پایان‌نامه Negm (نزدیک‌ترین کار پیشین) عیناً می‌گوید:\n\n> «**Incorporating other pressure influencing network elements such as pumps and air valves would add to the capabilities of the pressure control. The simplest way to achieve this is to add the new elements to the action space controlled by a single agent.**»\n\nیعنی نوآوری اول پروژه شما، **دقیقاً توصیه صریح کارهای‌آینده نزدیک‌ترین کار پیشین** است. آخرین استخراج:","type":"text"}],"id":"msg_bdrk_axevozdw3qg6delx3o2t26ibspnerva4gcum3vywjd5f43bpfp5a","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1963,"cache_read_input_tokens":294641,"output_tokens":2242,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1963},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"20260825063047623760467r5wstmlyAJnuR","type":"assistant","uuid":"f44c3ca4-5df0-481d-9431-bf5057cc1709","timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:31:20.989Z","effort":"max","session_id":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\Thesis","sessionId":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","version":"2.1.240","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"f44c3ca4-5df0-481d-9431-bf5057cc1709","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01Bq4zqtwjZJCn7XFekHYCqc","input":{"command":"F=\"/d/Thesis/papers/Leveraging Deep Reinforcement Learning for WaterDistribution Systems with Large Action Spaces and Uncertainties DRL-EPANET for Pressure Control.pdf\"; echo \"=== counts ===\"; for t in PDA DDA emitter \"pressure-driven\" \"reward\" \"demand uncertainty\" \"pump\" \"generaliz\" \"2.2\" \"discretiz\"; do printf \"%-18s \" \"$t\"; pdftotext -enc UTF-8 \"$F\" - 2>/dev/null | grep -aoi -- \"$t\" | wc -l; done; echo \"=== state/action/reward ===\"; pdftotext -enc UTF-8 \"$F\" - 2>/dev/null | grep -aoiE \".{70}(reward is|reward function|state space|observation space|action space consists|leakage is model).{160}\" | head -5","description":"Extract Belfadil DRL-EPANET design details"},"name":"Bash","type":"tool_use"}],"id":"msg_bdrk_axevozdw3qg6delx3o2t26ibspnerva4gcum3vywjd5f43bpfp5a","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1963,"cache_read_input_tokens":294641,"output_tokens":2242,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1963},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"20260825063047623760467r5wstmlyAJnuR","type":"assistant","uuid":"4844094f-a3a8-4763-a006-e69b205d63fc","timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:31:24.606Z","effort":"max","session_id":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\Thesis","sessionId":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","version":"2.1.240","gitBranch":"main"}
