{"parentUuid":"6121ac6d-3e9d-44bd-86ad-313678be5b2f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"**تأیید Priority 1 — یافته مهم:**\n\n**Cyriac & Chacko (2026) — CONFIRMED:** «Deep Reinforcement Learning for Pressure Optimization in Water Distribution Networks with Multiple Pumping Stations», **ASCE JWRPM**, منتشرشده **۱ ژوئیه ۲۰۲۶**, DOI **10.1061/JWRMD5.WRENG-7303**, Heriot-Watt University UAE. **این مقاله بعد از Proposal شما (بهمن ۱۴۰۴) منتشر شده — شما نمی‌توانستید بدانید.**\n\n**کشف جدید:** Li et al. (2024, preprint DOI 10.21203/rs.3.rs-4399025/v1) — «PRVs at DMA inlets **co-scheduled with fixed- and variable-speed pumps** via genetic algorithm» برای کنترل نشت + صرفه انرژی.\n\n**شبکه Hu/Gao/Zhong تأیید شد: EPANET Net 3**، با قانون نشت Giustolisi (نمای aₖ=1.2) و **پاداش نرمال‌شده نسبت به benchmark تصادفی**.\n\nادامه تأیید:","type":"text"}],"id":"c602b426ce2938e816f299bc8bd19156","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4825,"cache_read_input_tokens":333613,"output_tokens":3061,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4825},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"20260825064700428125442fcmflrkyTroQm","type":"assistant","uuid":"072e939a-26ef-447d-af85-d0872c5b0c6c","timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:47:40.213Z","effort":"max","session_id":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\Thesis","sessionId":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","version":"2.1.240","gitBranch":"main"}
