{"parentUuid":"a5028a22-2ecf-4658-ae4d-a81276fccc3f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"**⚠️⚠️ خطای جدی در گزارش Phase 1.5 خودم — باید صریحاً تصحیح شود.**\n\nبا تطبیق مرزِ-کلمه (`\\bPDA\\b`)، **هر سه مقاله PDA=0 و DDA=0** هستند. شمارش‌های قبلی من (Negm=۶۹، Belfadil=۹، Hu=۸) کاملاً artifact زیررشته `pda` داخل کلمات **update/updates/updating/updated** بود — که در یک متن DRL (policy update، gradient update، target-network update) طبیعتاً پرتکرار است.\n\nبنابراین ادعای من که «هر سه کار نزدیک PDA به‌کار برده‌اند» **باطل است**. تأیید درست با عبارت‌های واقعی:","type":"text"}],"id":"337d9cd6f173c81713656aaef3af102d","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1999,"cache_read_input_tokens":348596,"output_tokens":1958,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1999},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"2026082506504331735875199gwgdrpWdS7F","type":"assistant","uuid":"47ea8095-79f4-4109-a203-c0d00b34ed40","timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:51:15.072Z","effort":"max","session_id":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\Thesis","sessionId":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","version":"2.1.240","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"47ea8095-79f4-4109-a203-c0d00b34ed40","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01H3hhYXMam5E7D7LMbYfYaF","input":{"command":"for f in \"Water pressure optimisation for leakage management using deep reinforcement learning\" \"Leveraging Deep Reinforcement Learning for WaterDistribution Systems with Large Action Spaces and Uncertainties DRL-EPANET for Pressure Control\"; do echo \"### $(echo \"$f\" | cut -c1-40)\"; for t in \"pressure-driven\" \"pressure driven\" \"demand-driven\" \"demand driven\" \"pressure-dependent\" \"pressure dependent\" \"PDD\" \"emitter\" \"FAVAD\" \"leakage exponent\" \"Germanopoulos\" \"Giustolisi\"; do printf \"  %-20s \" \"$t\"; pdftotext -enc UTF-8 \"/d/Thesis/papers/$f.pdf\" - 2>/dev/null | grep -aoi -- \"$t\" | wc -l; done; done","description":"Verify actual hydraulic model terms in Negm and Belfadil"},"name":"Bash","type":"tool_use"}],"id":"337d9cd6f173c81713656aaef3af102d","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1999,"cache_read_input_tokens":348596,"output_tokens":1958,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1999},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"2026082506504331735875199gwgdrpWdS7F","type":"assistant","uuid":"304abbd8-f715-437f-a56f-c17327f8939c","timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:51:18.263Z","effort":"max","session_id":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\Thesis","sessionId":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","version":"2.1.240","gitBranch":"main"}
