{"parentUuid":"e61ad22a-bc80-4e56-9a6f-a826603f6f96","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"**🔴 یافته بحرانی Phase 1.5-B — Cyriac & Chacko (2026) کاملاً تأیید شد و ارزیابی Novelty را تغییر می‌دهد:**\n\n- **ASCE JWRPM، جلد ۱۵۲، شماره ۷**، تاریخ انتشار OpenAlex: **۵ می ۲۰۲۶**، Heriot-Watt Malaysia، closed access، ۰ استناد\n- **نقل مستقیم از Abstract:** پژوهش‌های پیشین «**overlooked using pressure control with RL in continuous action spaces**» ← **دقیقاً همان شکافی که نوآوری اول شما ادعا می‌کند**\n- محیط آموزش **بر پایه Gym** با «a calibrated hydraulic model»، مطالعه موردی **شبکه واقعی ابوظبی**\n- عامل **setpoint ایستگاه‌های پمپاژ** را بلادرنگ تنظیم می‌کند تا فشار حداکثر شبکه سقف‌گذاری شود و حداقل هر DMA حفظ گردد\n- نتایج: کاهش **مصرف انرژی + ریسک آسیب لوله** بدون افت اطمینان سرویس\n- **و ادعای «transferable to networks of other sizes and layouts»** ← این **قوی‌ترین نوآوری باقی‌مانده شما (تعمیم‌پذیری) را تهدید می‌کند**\n\nتأیید آخرین شاهد حمایتی PPO:","type":"text"}],"id":"4256fcefbf99c108d49a8cc05c19353e","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":378323,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2618,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":378323},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"202608250701551948845057gtq6Sq1vwF7c","type":"assistant","uuid":"85bc9362-e273-49af-a9bc-20fe4182b775","timestamp":"2026-08-24T23:02:41.423Z","effort":"max","session_id":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\Thesis","sessionId":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","version":"2.1.240","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"85bc9362-e273-49af-a9bc-20fe4182b775","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01Doy4k165hXYp3axzFLSkA3","input":{"prompt":"Report title, authors, journal, publication date, DOI, and reconstruct the abstract if an abstract_inverted_index is present. Summarize findings about PPO vs DQN vs A3C, learning rate sensitivity, and noise robustness.","url":"https://api.openalex.org/works?search=multi-algorithm%20reinforcement%20learning%20framework%20feedforward%20networks%20resilient%20water%20tank%20scheduling&per-page=2"},"name":"WebFetch","type":"tool_use"}],"id":"4256fcefbf99c108d49a8cc05c19353e","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":378323,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2618,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":378323},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"202608250701551948845057gtq6Sq1vwF7c","type":"assistant","uuid":"7371e866-8a43-44c1-ad3a-bec5e0e688e8","timestamp":"2026-08-24T23:02:43.608Z","effort":"max","session_id":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\Thesis","sessionId":"a4cbf1ac-8d99-42b4-9b8e-e55353a1e1c4","version":"2.1.240","gitBranch":"main"}
